    difficulty: 'medium',
    stem: 'A 32-year-old Black lesbian says she hears racist remarks at LGBTQ+ social events and anti-gay sermons at the Black church where she grew up. She says, "I have to leave part of myself at the door wherever I go." Which approach BEST reflects the Multicultural and Social Justice Counseling Competencies?',
